0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> cups of water?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Thu, Oct 15th @ 2:00 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:12</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
